<title>USA: Omaha hogs steady-off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs steady-off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady, instances $0.50 lower. Top $58.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US  1-3    220-270 lbs    58.50</p>
<p>US  2-3    260-280 lbs    57.50-58.00</p>
<p>Sows: 20 percent. Relatively scarce, uneven, steady. Top 48.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    350-450 lbs     46.50</p>
<p>	     450-500 lbs    47.00</p>
<p>US 2-3     500-650 lbs, few 48.00</p>
</text>
